DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20261001T113000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20261001T121500
SUMMARY:Alumni in der Streaming-Branche
LOCATION:Filmgalerie Empfang
DESCRIPTION:Pflicht\nDozent*innen: Morgane Dubief\, Eun-Zi Kim\, Benjamin M
 unz\, Verena Schilling\, Julius Windhorst\n\nhttps://ev3nts.filmakademie.d
 e/user/student/?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-01
