 nd photo data into 3D models\n\n• Analysis of practical examples from St
 udio Babelsberg’s AI Masterclass\n\n----------------------\n\nFri\, 9 Se
 ptember 2026 – Morning\n\nIntegration of the gameplay footage\n\n• Int
 egration of the recorded gameplay footage into the 3D models\n\n• Option
 al use of the LED wall in the swimming pool\n\n• Technical support for m
 otion control and Unreal integration\n\nFri\, 9 September 2026 – Afterno
 on\n\nCreative variations\n\n• Variations in the background\n\n• Adjus
 ting the lighting design\n\n• Interaction with proxies and props\n\nhttp
 s://ev3nts.filmakademie.de/user/student/?from=2026-10-08&to=2026-10-08
